# Symbulator circuit book

title: Circuits for Lesson 7 of the Tutorial

[AS7's Example 9.9]

e,1,0,10
r1,1,2,5
c,2,0,.1

analysis: ac
omega: 4
note: The first AC problem. The source is the phasor of 10 cos(4t), and the capacitor is in farads, which is why the frequency is needed.
rounding: 4
si: no
units: yes
rms: no
polar: yes


